2ca8-c45d-4668-ba34-35ab3b8584ca" facs="#m-343b1e29-eb45-44f8-8d8f-a5c9ab5377e4" label="ambiguous">17.</l><l xml:id="m-2ef1b859-71a5-446e-a3ef-bca2fc1d11fe" facs="#m-5ad23779-10d6-4ad6-8e2d-65a3e7fec7cb" label="ambiguous">St. Hyacinth, Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-6eaaf519-0958-4a82-907c-d017cc2183b9" facs="#m-93273b64-eb0e-40b4-b1a0-b4638716a66c" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-5c3eca63-839b-46cd-a51c-86eb3c1ce1a6" facs="#m-30218487-4118-4997-ad05-60ab95a4f186" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi. p. 1200.</l><l xml:id="m-05591931-e7f3-4fed-8d2c-2eea15f032a4" facs="#m-ef059173-9b30-4b6d-b503-922222458810" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-bdeca6d5-17ea-4c39-99bc-d453836bf262" facs="#m-c54d84d7-76ea-4d02-9a14-afdc8a1e3c6f" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos beáti Hyacinthil ut cujus natalitia cólimus, "étiam</l><l xml:id="m-ad94cc84-c640-491f-a750-f95260097754" facs="#m-07197d54-a98e-4069-8efe-009f7c172f93" label="lyrics-like">I Confessóris tui ánnua solemni- actiónes imitémur. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-e4ffe907-c263-44cf-96d3-1ebaf2bc3fa0" facs="#m-e32c1231-27f3-42de-9799-275a9be81585" label="lyrics-like">táte laetíficas:t concéde propítius; l nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-43d2a9a6-1fae-403b-9f0a-e62b8daea666" facs="#m-aee68e4a-19e3-4723-9b16-97362ce9a84c" label="text-like">Commemoration of Octave of St. Lawrenee, Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-8dbb6dc7-6010-46a4-a8a2-8989861cfb1c" facs="#m-5d79328d-aed3-433a-9b9a-936d73455ed9" label="text-like">Antiphons and Versicles of the Feast, p. 1598.</l><l xml:id="m-0dee7c33-f817-4e2b-a102-aaba68042524" facs="#m-ce626bc4-a82b-4c20-8370-8a26c6883be2" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-3c769420-87ff-4335-bd59-8acbd80b7169" facs="#m-23c4e015-a87f-45f1-b6c0-82e6cd7a402e" label="lyrics-like">(Xcita Dómine in Ecclésia tua] amávit,“ et ópere exercére quod</l><l xml:id="m-8cc4b759-f112-4f88-97c3-047630b97fdd" facs="#m-25e12fca-6a6b-422b-899a-772618098595" label="lyrics-like">LSpiritum, cui beátus Laurén-[ dócuit. Per Dóminum nostrum...</l><l xml:id="m-b6b73999-c804-4d48-9487-c3bdc4728653" facs="#m-8eb872ec-f156-4c31-a451-0b0492d4adf5" label="lyrics-like">in unitáte ejúsdem Spiritus.</l><l xml:id="m-03165917-5aba-412c-9605-2199e8f45c61" facs="#m-ab37d3fb-1b48-4bba-a1c8-61c5131ccf5a" label="lyrics-like">tius Levita servivit: t ut eódem</l><l xml:id="m-9a430dd4-f40d-4b74-9fac-c48356c85aaa" facs="#m-2fc97bfd-a8b1-4c20-b311-05e8a3811fea" label="lyrics-like">nos repléti, studeámus amâre quod</l><l xml:id="m-93b5bf01-640e-4b12-ad4b-9ccda05b7f05" facs="#m-14871c66-f03d-4439-8806-84044e19895d" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-b636725d-8f03-4007-844a-bc9edff63b13" facs="#m-07798c85-4291-47ca-873e-57999bd4784f" label="lyrics-like">YAcrificium nostrum tibi, Dómine] honóre solémniter exhibétur, ejus</l><l xml:id="m-aaac5314-87db-43b8-be3d-301c2f815d3d" facs="#m-23bd34e9-f1fe-48c7-94fe-e33c15ed7985" label="lyrics-like">O quaésumus, beáti Lauréntii pre¬</l><l xml:id="m-173dfe75-ea46-449b-afef-2d3034dcfd70" facs="#m-8cf7eab8-0552-4711-88b3-cc1a8213f036" label="lyrics-like">méritis efficiátur accéptum. Per</l><l xml:id="m-93f0a771-5d53-490d-b63d-15c0e292a910" facs="#m-257fd7f8-d093-42bb-a399-465633e48939" label="lyrics-like">cátio sancta conciliet: ut cujus ! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-65fdc2d3-a79f-4790-adfa-6e596d1c8d89" facs="#m-fa65dfcd-990f-46a3-adb1-86ffb923b3eb" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-465ad164-d748-4097-a847-c96f5f0625de" facs="#m-39eb41cf-7748-4666-a7bf-0c1765b29283" label="lyrics-like">Upplices te rogámus, omnípo-Lauréntio Mártyre tuo, perpétua</l><l xml:id="m-90e5bd3d-1bd6-487b-a926-4fe2bb1a7c3e" facs="#m-43506974-d2a2-4e2b-8883-4e35e0fb3055" label="lyrics-like">O tens Deus: ut quos donis caélé¬</l><l xml:id="m-68e37e1e-48d1-4d91-9d67-e7de79c5c1fc" facs="#m-fecfbde4-b40d-4cca-8ca8-c920cb8d14a1" label="lyrics-like">protectióne custódias. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-0dd9ea49-613d-4e44-a07f-b7c486f2815f" facs="#m-7ad20a5b-34f2-418f-b183-28a879a3f632" label="lyrics-like">sibus satiásti, intercedénte beáto ! num.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
